=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">计划；方案；计量器；测量仪器；总；合计</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"190232\"><ruby>一年<rp>(</rp><rt>いちねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>計<rp>(</rp><rt>けい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>元旦<rp>(</rp><rt>がんたん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあり。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">New Year&#x27;s Day is the key to the year.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">敬意</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尊敬；敬意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144835\"><ruby>親<rp>(</rp><rt>おや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>敬意<rp>(</rp><rt>けいい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>表<rp>(</rp><rt>あらわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さなければいけない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You should be respectful to your parents.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">経緯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">原委；经过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>事件<rp>(</rp><rt>じけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>経緯<rp>(</rp><rt>けいい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>詳<rp>(</rp><rt>くわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しく<ruby>説明<rp>(</rp><rt>せつめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">详细说明事件的来龙去脉。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">緯</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">経営</span><span class=\"v-r\